# No AI commit attribution

Never add Cursor, Copilot, ChatGPT, Claude, or other AI attribution to git
commits or pull requests. That includes the Source Control generate-commit-message
button, `git commit`, and `gh pr create`.

```
# BAD — do not write or keep these
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Made-with: Cursor
Made with Cursor
Generated-by: Cursor
Assisted-by: AI

# GOOD
feat(ui-kit): add Tooltip primitive

Human Co-authored-by trailers for real people are fine:
Co-authored-by: Jane Doe <jane@example.com>
```
